# Environment variables

Copy to `.env` for local development, and set the same keys in Vercel →
Project → Settings → Environment Variables for production.

## Required

| Variable | Example | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `DATABASE_URL` | `postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/db` | Postgres connection used by Drizzle. Required — the app refuses to boot without it. |

## Database performance (optional)

| Variable | Default in code | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `DATABASE_POOL_MAX` | `10` | Max connections each server instance keeps open. With a transaction pooler (Supabase port `6543`) the default is fine. |

See [`docs/database-performance.md`](./docs/database-performance.md) — the single
biggest speed factor is running Vercel Functions in the **same region** as the database.

## Security (set in production)

| Variable | Default in code | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ADMIN_PASSWORD` | `estatewx2026` | Single password for `/admin`. **Change this in production.** |
| `SESSION_SECRET` | `estatewx-dev-session-secret` | HMAC secret for admin and visitor session cookies. Set a long random string. |

## SEO verification (optional, read at build time)

| Variable | Where to get it | Rendered as |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION` | Google Search Console → URL prefix property → HTML tag | `<meta name="google-site-verification" …>` |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_SITE_VERIFICATION` | Bing Webmaster Tools | `<meta name="msvalidate.01" …>` |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_YANDEX_SITE_VERIFICATION` | Yandex Webmaster | `<meta name="yandex-verification" …>` |

Google **domain** properties (DNS TXT) do not need a meta tag at all — verify the
domain once and every subdomain, including `www` and previews, is covered.

## Sandbox preview only (not needed in production)

| Variable | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `PGLITE_DATA_DIR` | Data directory for `scripts/preview-db.mjs`, the PGlite server that stands in for Postgres inside the Arena sandbox. |
| `PGLITE_PORT` | Port for that server (default `5432`). |

The launch checklist lives in [`docs/seo-launch-checklist.md`](./seo-launch-checklist.md).
